What this covers
----------------
Every image and video in this repository that depicts Legatum is under CC BY 4.0, wherever
it sits: generated art, sprites, icons, heraldry, screenshots, diagrams and film. The main
places are:

- app/src/assets/      unit, city, era, leader, people, resource and key art, icons and heraldry
- app/public/terrain/  terrain sprites
- app/public/wonders/  natural-wonder sprites
- app/public/favicon*, apple-touch-icon.png  the app icon
- docs/media/          screenshots, diagrams and film
- docs/design/         design-review images

Images elsewhere (for example under docs/playtests/, docs/research/, docs/status/,
docs/sim-results/, tools/design/ and app/e2e/) are covered in the same way.

